      "body_html": "<p>A creamy blend of organic coffee with oat milk and a touch of maple sugar.</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Our classic latte made vegan with a rich and creamy oat milk base. Just rip, pour, and stir for an energizing latte on the go!\u00a0</span><br></p>\n<p><strong>To prepare</strong>, add one packet to 8-10 oz (1-1.25 C) of hot water, stir, and enjoy!</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">___________________</p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">CALORIES\u00a0</strong>| 85</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">CAFFEINE\u00a0</strong>| 75mg</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">SERVINGS PER BOX\u00a0</strong>| 8 packets</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Ingredients: Oat Milk </strong>(Oats, Coconut Oil, Enzymes)<strong>, Organic Coffee, Maple Sugar.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Contains</strong> Tree Nuts (Coconut)</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
