      "body_html": "<p>The first of our Artist Series T-Shirts, featuring artwork from Nikki Moon- a Durango based artist who absolutely NAILED it with this design.\u00a0</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Color | Sandstone Green\u00a0</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">100% ring-spun USA cotton Comfort Colors T-Shirt</li>\n<li>High-quality heavyweight tee<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n</li>\n<li>Preshrunk, soft-washed, and garment-dyed fabric for lasting quality and a vintage look.\u00a0</li>\n<li>Made with sustainably and fairly grown USA cotton\u00a0</li>\n<li>Dyed with Pigment Pure to produce earth friendly colors with 3 times less water, 40% less process time, less energy consumption, and zero salt.\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n</ul>",
