      "handle": "mix-match-meal-bundle",
      "body_html": "<script>\n  window.location.replace(\"/pages/build-your-bundle\");\n</script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    display: none!important;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<p data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"924\"><strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"702\">Build your perfect Farm to Summit bundle.</strong><br data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"705\">Choose your favorite meals and create a custom mix for trail days, camp weekends, road trips, and easy backup meals at home. From comforting classics to bold, adventurous flavors, this bundle lets you stock up your way.</p>\n<p data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"1079\">Crafted for convenience and made to go wherever adventure calls, these meals are lightweight, satisfying, and easy to prepare \u2014 just add water and enjoy.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1104\"><strong data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1104\">Why you\u2019ll love it:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1286\">\n<li data-section-id=\"7t03wv\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1133\">Pick your favorite flavors</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"o0t0tu\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1188\">Great for camping, hiking, travel, and pantry backup</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rsyed8\" data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1206\">Easy to prepare</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l3nw7i\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1233\">Lightweight and packable</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkgeot\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1286\">A fun way to try a variety of Farm to Summit meals</li>\n</ul>",
